\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Ablations. Probe rows: balanced accuracy (binary unless noted) at $L^\ast $, mean $\pm $ s.d.\ over three scenario splits, and the split-0 value with its 95\% scenario-bootstrap CI (test $n=344$ items per split, six held-out contexts). Transfer rows: train on all of one environment, test on all of the other ($n=607$ and $1714$). $^\dagger $One split only (a deviation; see Table\nobreakspace  {}\ref  {tab:deviations}). $^\ddagger $The last action token is always the same closing bracket, so this probe is at chance by construction; the mean-pooled layer-0 row is the informative embedding baseline. Ablation (5): irreversible-action rate and task success on the 60 irreversible versions, neutral $\rightarrow $ careful system prompt.\relax }}{8}{table.caption.27}\protected@file@percent }
